From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yggdrasil UPC Overlay <yggdrasil@unheaded.dev>
Date: Sun, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] preinstall upc-* packages as Required

The packer build (nix/yggdrasil/packer/template.pkr.hcl) consumes this
list and emits an `apt-get install -y` line in the provision phase. The
"Required" priority means apt won't allow these to be removed without
forcing.

Task #71 — UPC accessible & present on Yggdrasil.

---
 etc/yggdrasil/required-packages.d/upc.list | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 etc/yggdrasil/required-packages.d/upc.list

diff --git a/etc/yggdrasil/required-packages.d/upc.list b/etc/yggdrasil/required-packages.d/upc.list
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2222222
--- /dev/null
+++ b/etc/yggdrasil/required-packages.d/upc.list
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Yggdrasil — UPC required packages
+# Installed at image-build time. Cannot be removed without `apt --force`.
+upc-bootctl
+upc-tty-bridge
+monad-cpu-ebpf
+unheaded-shared
+unheaded-runner
--
2.43.0
